<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE SETS NEW MARKET CAPITALISATION HIGH.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE SETS NEW MARKET CAPITALISATION HIGH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Thursday that the close of trade on Wednesday had seen it set a new high for market capitalisation.</p>
<p>The fresh record of 1,316 billion rand beat the previous high of 1,307 billion rand set on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
